# Never send dependencies, build output, VCS data or anything secret to the build context.
**/node_modules
.git
.github
**/dist
**/coverage
test-results
playwright-report
.env
.env.*
**/*.decrypted
**/*.ejson.decrypted
**/*.ejson.tmp
.ejson-keys
**/keys
*.log
.DS_Store
docs/handoff
docs/review
web/HANDOFF.md
# Secrets files are mounted at run time, never built in (the migrate target ships the build stage).
config/*.ejson
